  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The pioneering vision-language model for pathology — Nature Medicine 2023, 75k+ monthly HuggingFace downloads, zero-shot tissue classification from free-text prompts. Training data sourced from medical Twitter (now X), which raises questions about data provenance and long-term reproducibility. Assess pending cleaner dataset documentation and broader independent validation. Useful for teams prototyping zero-shot pathology classification pipelines before committing to task-specific fine-tuning.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
